<%= @heading %>

Your Firezone account "<%= @account.slug %>" (<%= @account.id %>) <%= case @level do %>
<% :over -> %>has more monthly active users than the seats included in your subscription.
<% :at_limit -> %>has used every monthly active user seat included in your subscription.
<% _ -> %>is close to the number of monthly active users included in your subscription.
<% end %>

Current monthly active users: <%= @active_users_count %>
Seats in your subscription: <%= @seats_limit %>
<%= case @level do %>
<% :over -> %>Seats over your subscription: <%= @seats_over %>
<% _ -> %>Seats remaining: <%= @seats_remaining %>
<% end %>

What happens next?
<%= case @level do %>
<% :over -> %>Your users can still sign in and connect. To add seats to your subscription, contact your account manager.
<% :at_limit -> %>New users cannot sign in or connect until you add seats. Users who are already active are not affected.

To add seats, go to Org Settings -> Account (<%= @billing_url %>) in the admin portal and click the "Manage plan" button.
<% _ -> %>When all seats are used, new users cannot sign in or connect until you add seats. Users who are already active are not affected.

To add seats, go to Org Settings -> Account (<%= @billing_url %>) in the admin portal and click the "Manage plan" button.
<% end %>

If you have any questions, just reply to this email to reach our support team.

Thanks,
The Firezone Team

